    <briefdescription>
<para>Tamper-evident chain of DistributionReceipts for one artifact. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_receipt_chain" kindref="compound">ReceiptChain</ref> is the ordered, linked sequence of all DistributionReceipts ever issued for one artifact (identified by artifact_id). Each receipt in the chain carries the parent_receipt_hash of its predecessor.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This is a value type. The <ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_provenance_hash_ledger" kindref="compound">ProvenanceHashLedger</ref> is the authoritative store for live receipt chains. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
